abstract: >-
  A formal, executable, symbolically traceable language based on 20 universal
  semantic primitives (Alpha-20), designed to be written, read, and executed
  by humans, AI agents, and software across scientific disciplines.
  Every artifact is sealed with SHA-256, GPG signature, and OpenTimestamps.
keywords:
  - universal language
  - executable specification
  - semantic primitives
  - cryptographic provenance
  - OpenTimestamps
